WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.880 --> 01:31.080
[My Journey to You]

01:31.120 --> 01:34.100
[Episode 2]

01:48.030 --> 01:48.850
Gong Ziyu.

03:36.950 --> 03:38.550
I'm not trying to let them go.

03:38.610 --> 03:39.550
It's just a trap.

03:39.590 --> 03:40.710
Interesting.

03:40.940 --> 03:42.660
I thought the most famous playboy of the Gong family

03:42.660 --> 03:44.260
only knows how to play cards.

03:44.590 --> 03:46.670
Then let me play along with you so that it seems more realistic.

03:46.670 --> 03:47.490
Don't get me wrong.

03:47.490 --> 03:48.490
I'm not mistaken.

03:48.990 --> 03:51.250
I'm just making the best of a bad bargain.

04:05.140 --> 04:06.080
Gong Yuanzhi.

04:06.730 --> 04:08.460
They are all bride candidates.

04:08.630 --> 04:11.130
You're being too negligent of the consequences.

04:11.130 --> 04:14.260
You're indeed the most tender towards women, Young Master Ziyu.

04:14.260 --> 04:16.390
But if there's a Wufeng spy among them,

04:16.970 --> 04:19.000
they should all be executed.

04:22.600 --> 04:24.130
They are already poisoned.

04:24.340 --> 04:25.600
Without my antidote,

04:26.590 --> 04:28.990
they'll just have to wait for their deaths.

04:41.500 --> 04:42.760
Are we really going to die?

04:42.760 --> 04:43.670
I'm scared.

04:44.780 --> 04:45.640
Help me.

04:53.180 --> 04:54.510
I won't die here, right?

04:54.670 --> 04:55.530
I don't want to.

04:55.659 --> 04:56.920
I don't want to die yet.

05:02.070 --> 05:03.130
What are you doing?

05:05.510 --> 05:06.570
Congratulations.

05:07.190 --> 05:08.590
Your trap has succeeded.

05:08.720 --> 05:10.250
The bug has entered the pit.

05:10.700 --> 05:13.430
Bring the antidote to us in exchange for his life.

05:13.870 --> 05:14.900
You can try.

05:15.660 --> 05:18.830
Let's see if you'll die first or he'll die first.

05:20.170 --> 05:21.700
What are you talking about?

05:37.480 --> 05:38.280
Take her away.

05:43.380 --> 05:44.380
Brother Yuanzhi.

05:45.150 --> 05:46.210
You were reckless.

05:52.420 --> 05:53.080
Young Lord.

05:54.600 --> 05:56.680
I was desperate to save Brother Ziyu.

05:57.630 --> 05:59.690
The acupoints below the knees are connected to the elbows.

05:59.690 --> 06:01.410
Since his elbows were numbed,

06:02.140 --> 06:03.990
Brother Ziyu should be safe.

06:04.900 --> 06:05.460
Besides,

06:05.990 --> 06:08.090
Brother Ziyu had eagerly set up a trap.

06:08.090 --> 06:10.150
I couldn't let his effort go to waste.

06:11.030 --> 06:12.140
Didn't we catch her in the end?

06:12.140 --> 06:12.740
Nonsense.

06:14.220 --> 06:16.420
You obviously tried to kill me just now.

06:17.160 --> 06:18.160
Brother Yuanzhi.

06:19.030 --> 06:19.830
Next time,

06:20.500 --> 06:21.700
don't be so reckless.

06:23.380 --> 06:23.840
Yes,

06:24.310 --> 06:25.000
Young Lord.

07:28.160 --> 07:28.690
Morning.

07:29.700 --> 07:30.760
Does it still hurt?

07:31.250 --> 07:32.130
A little.

07:33.940 --> 07:35.540
Why did you pull such a foolish stunt last night?

07:35.540 --> 07:37.790
You clearly can't defeat Gong Yuanzhi in a fight, but you insisted on...

07:37.790 --> 07:39.520
Who can't defeat Gong Yuanzhi?

07:40.390 --> 07:41.950
If it weren't for you hindering me,

07:41.950 --> 07:44.260
it would probably have been a balanced fight.

07:44.260 --> 07:45.470
Dream on.

07:45.490 --> 07:46.290
Shut up.

07:48.790 --> 07:50.390
I need to find someone later.

07:50.540 --> 07:51.440
Don't follow me.

07:51.440 --> 07:52.220
Wait for me here.

07:52.220 --> 07:53.100
What are you going to do?

07:53.100 --> 07:54.360
None of your business.

07:55.810 --> 07:57.320
I swear on my conscience

07:57.430 --> 07:59.440
that I really don't want to care about you.

07:59.440 --> 08:00.840
Do you have a conscience?

08:05.470 --> 08:06.000
I do.

08:06.400 --> 08:07.730
But it was eaten by a dog.

08:12.610 --> 08:14.270
[Zhi]

08:47.040 --> 08:48.120
Someone was here.

08:56.050 --> 08:58.470
Chi, Mei, Wang, and Liang.

08:59.880 --> 09:01.580
I heard that Wufeng assassins

09:02.420 --> 09:04.080
are divided into four levels.

09:05.820 --> 09:07.710
With your ability and skills,

09:09.440 --> 09:11.770
you're probably in the lowest level, Chi.

09:14.980 --> 09:15.610
Sigh.

09:16.220 --> 09:17.950
It was such a good opportunity,

09:18.300 --> 09:19.900
yet they actually sent a Chi.

09:23.190 --> 09:24.720
Was this a suicide mission?

09:26.740 --> 09:27.940
We Wufeng people

09:28.470 --> 09:29.350
are not afraid of death.

09:29.350 --> 09:29.770
Oh?

09:31.660 --> 09:32.080
Yes.

09:33.320 --> 09:35.320
Many people are not afraid of death.

09:36.870 --> 09:37.930
But that's because

09:38.570 --> 09:39.270
sometimes,

09:40.340 --> 09:41.340
living is scarier

09:42.710 --> 09:43.550
than death.

09:46.340 --> 09:47.580
You must be the Gong Yuanzhi that they talk about,

09:47.580 --> 09:49.580
who's adept at using poison.

09:50.710 --> 09:52.100
Even if I die,

09:53.150 --> 09:55.040
I won't drink your poison wine.

09:57.690 --> 09:58.470
It's fine if

09:59.830 --> 10:00.800
you don't want to

10:01.680 --> 10:03.340
drink this cup of poison wine.

10:37.750 --> 10:39.550
I need you to do something for me.

10:40.810 --> 10:42.740
I'm willing to do anything for you.

10:52.980 --> 10:53.670
I want you

10:54.110 --> 10:55.570
to protect someone for me.

11:53.490 --> 11:55.420
We're not going to die here, right?

12:11.350 --> 12:12.990
Bring the incense burner to the brides.

12:12.990 --> 12:13.430
Yes.

12:18.430 --> 12:19.500
Young Master.

12:19.540 --> 12:20.870
What are you doing here?

12:21.060 --> 12:22.250
I just came to look around.

12:22.250 --> 12:23.130
Nonsense.

12:23.340 --> 12:25.510
This is the Ladies' Hostel. What is there to see?

12:25.510 --> 12:26.830
Go to Wanhua Pavilion if you want to look at women.

12:26.830 --> 12:27.270
Hey.

12:28.240 --> 12:29.040
Young Master.

12:30.340 --> 12:30.660
Hurry.

12:30.660 --> 12:31.560
Guard the door.

12:31.830 --> 12:33.700
Don't let anyone find out that Young Master is here.

12:33.700 --> 12:34.980
Or he'll be in big trouble.

12:34.980 --> 12:35.380
Yes.

12:38.430 --> 12:40.090
And I'll be in bigger trouble.

12:43.010 --> 12:44.070
Young Master Ziyu.

12:45.570 --> 12:46.630
Young Master Ziyu?

12:47.000 --> 12:48.200
What is he doing here?

12:48.950 --> 12:50.380
Why is he here?

13:04.830 --> 13:05.830
Wait for a moment.

13:13.360 --> 13:14.420
Young Master Ziyu.

13:20.730 --> 13:22.660
Thank you for your help last night.

13:25.060 --> 13:26.530
Don't call me Young Master Ziyu.

13:26.530 --> 13:27.530
Call me Gong Ziyu.

13:33.720 --> 13:34.580
Isn't it funny?

13:37.520 --> 13:38.780
My name is Yun Weishan.

13:39.600 --> 13:40.860
"Yun" as in the clouds,

13:41.240 --> 13:42.640
and "shan" as in clothes.

13:45.270 --> 13:46.870
The clouds are your clothes.

13:48.270 --> 13:50.190
What a poetic and great name.

13:52.750 --> 13:53.690
How did you know

13:53.840 --> 13:55.440
I'm here for this mask today?

13:56.300 --> 13:57.890
The coloring on this mask

13:58.340 --> 14:00.750
is not ordinary oil paint or color paste,

14:01.860 --> 14:03.690
but a very thin layer of glaze.

14:04.530 --> 14:07.060
It's tough for ordinary craftsmen to create.

14:07.490 --> 14:09.550
It must be made by a skilled craftsman

14:09.620 --> 14:10.580
and expensive.

14:12.620 --> 14:13.680
If I were the owner,

14:14.450 --> 14:16.650
I would also be heartbroken if I lost it.

14:20.580 --> 14:22.470
It has nothing to do with the price.

14:22.470 --> 14:24.700
The main thing is that it can't be bought anymore.

14:24.700 --> 14:26.430
Has the craftsman passed away?

14:28.710 --> 14:29.660
You can say that.

14:32.760 --> 14:34.490
Has your body been detoxified?

14:35.030 --> 14:38.360
Last night, Young Lord sent the antidote here for everyone.

14:40.410 --> 14:41.340
I'm fine now.

14:43.230 --> 14:44.290
Young Master Ziyu.

14:50.350 --> 14:51.480
This medicine is...

14:51.570 --> 14:53.100
It's the Baizhi Jincao Tea.

14:57.700 --> 14:58.430
I'll hold it.

14:58.540 --> 14:59.340
You may leave.

14:59.760 --> 15:00.220
Yes.

15:03.120 --> 15:04.720
When I checked in last night,

15:04.950 --> 15:06.190
I had a bowl of

15:06.230 --> 15:07.560
this Baizhi Jincao Tea.

15:08.540 --> 15:10.940
They said that all outsiders have to take it

15:11.480 --> 15:14.610
to resist the fog of poisonous miasma in Jiuchen Valley.

15:16.370 --> 15:17.990
What's wrong, Young Master Ziyu?

15:17.990 --> 15:19.080
Is anything wrong?

15:20.470 --> 15:20.930
Oh.

15:21.350 --> 15:22.050
No.

15:22.700 --> 15:25.110
You must take this Baizhi Jincao Tea.

15:26.580 --> 15:27.840
The depths of the valley

15:27.840 --> 15:29.570
are scattered with rare herbs.

15:29.940 --> 15:32.260
But there are also many poisonous plants.

15:32.260 --> 15:35.360
The valley is constantly shrouded in poisonous miasma.

15:35.360 --> 15:37.820
If a woman stays in the valley for a long time,

15:39.270 --> 15:39.960
then...

15:44.800 --> 15:45.400
What?

15:47.420 --> 15:48.810
Then it'll be hard to

15:49.980 --> 15:50.710
bear a child.

16:05.150 --> 16:07.810
Miss Shangguan, please take the medicinal tea.

16:08.470 --> 16:09.800
Do I have to drink it now?

16:10.130 --> 16:10.930
Yes.

16:10.950 --> 16:13.810
I'll take the medicine cup back after you finish it.

16:13.910 --> 16:15.370
That's why the Gong family

16:15.630 --> 16:18.230
wants to marry brides from outside the valley.

16:18.870 --> 16:19.800
But don't worry.

16:20.230 --> 16:21.490
This Baizhi Jincao Tea

16:21.490 --> 16:23.220
is made for women to help resist the poisonous miasma

16:23.220 --> 16:24.680
and nourish their bodies.

16:27.230 --> 16:28.830
But this bowl of medicine...

16:29.370 --> 16:31.630
What's wrong with this bowl of medicine?

16:32.060 --> 16:33.190
Is there a problem?

16:34.180 --> 16:36.180
A few pieces of rat poop fell into it.

16:39.140 --> 16:40.150
Are you serious?

16:41.470 --> 16:42.020
Guess.

17:20.390 --> 17:21.420
Where did you go?

17:21.839 --> 17:24.170
I've been waiting for you this whole time.

17:29.640 --> 17:31.500
Aren't you a little too delicate?

17:31.630 --> 17:33.960
You need medicine even for a minor injury.

17:34.070 --> 17:35.730
This is the Baizhi Jincao Tea.

17:38.190 --> 17:39.830
Why are you drinking that?

17:39.970 --> 17:41.420
Are you out of your mind?

17:42.140 --> 17:45.670
I wouldn't drink the Baizhi Jincao Tea even if I'm out of my mind.

17:47.390 --> 17:48.450
Smell it yourself.

17:58.160 --> 17:59.490
This smell is not right.

18:00.220 --> 18:01.080
Is it poisoned?

18:01.990 --> 18:02.920
I'm not sure yet.

18:03.750 --> 18:06.060
But it's definitely not the original Baizhi Jincao Tea.

18:06.060 --> 18:06.880
Who did this?

18:07.180 --> 18:08.310
Who else could it be?

18:09.700 --> 18:10.700
The person who is

18:11.500 --> 18:13.790
most adept at using poison in the whole valley.

18:13.790 --> 18:14.590
Gong Yuanzhi.

18:18.290 --> 18:18.880
Ziyu.

18:20.220 --> 18:20.750
Brother.

18:28.010 --> 18:29.380
Did you go to the Ladies' Hostel

18:29.380 --> 18:30.980
to look for Miss Yun Weishan?

18:33.580 --> 18:34.110
Brother.

18:34.860 --> 18:35.990
How did you find out?

18:37.630 --> 18:38.660
Last night,

18:38.690 --> 18:40.530
I saw her wearing your mask.

18:40.930 --> 18:42.450
It's your treasure.

18:43.060 --> 18:44.520
You wouldn't have given it

18:45.180 --> 18:46.500
to a regular girl.

18:48.220 --> 18:49.290
I mean,

18:49.800 --> 18:51.180
how do you know her name?

18:54.330 --> 18:56.250
It's my turn to select a bride.

18:56.840 --> 18:58.700
About their family backgrounds,

18:59.020 --> 19:00.800
personalities, and names,

19:01.160 --> 19:02.760
of course I know everything.

19:07.930 --> 19:08.660
Don't worry.

19:09.400 --> 19:10.730
I won't choose Miss Yun.

19:13.890 --> 19:14.420
Brother.

19:14.940 --> 19:16.470
What are you talking about?

19:17.880 --> 19:18.540
Young Lord.

19:18.660 --> 19:19.560
Young Master Ziyu.

19:19.560 --> 19:21.560
Lord Sword Wielder wants to see you.

19:22.230 --> 19:22.760
Okay.

19:23.090 --> 19:24.220
We'll be there soon.

19:35.530 --> 19:36.010
Father.

19:38.580 --> 19:39.650
I heard from them

19:40.670 --> 19:42.860
that the identity of the assassin

19:43.300 --> 19:44.410
has been exposed.

19:45.320 --> 19:46.380
My brother and I...

19:49.330 --> 19:50.190
Young Lord and I

19:51.070 --> 19:51.870
planned to

19:51.910 --> 19:54.710
use the mechanism in the secret tunnel to lure out the assassin...

19:54.710 --> 19:57.230
I didn't expect you to have learned to lie.

19:59.140 --> 19:59.600
How could Young Lord

19:59.600 --> 20:01.370
be as stupid as you?

20:02.940 --> 20:04.600
You fancied yourself as smart

20:04.710 --> 20:06.970
and even want to get Young Lord involved.

20:07.960 --> 20:10.420
Ever since I said I wanted to kill the brides,

20:10.670 --> 20:12.180
it was already a trap.

20:13.050 --> 20:14.260
Huanyu and I

20:14.850 --> 20:16.580
had already discussed it.

20:19.070 --> 20:21.200
Of course we can't kill all the brides.

20:22.000 --> 20:23.400
Otherwise, there will be

20:24.180 --> 20:26.910
no place in the martial world for the Gong family.

20:27.480 --> 20:28.610
Then why did you

20:28.840 --> 20:30.440
say those things to Ziyu?

20:31.590 --> 20:33.990
He has been soft-hearted since he was little

20:33.990 --> 20:35.450
and tender towards women.

20:35.940 --> 20:38.140
If he knew I wanted to kill those brides,

20:38.610 --> 20:40.920
he would try his best to save them.

20:41.970 --> 20:44.900
Are you planning to use Ziyu to lure out the assassin?

20:46.510 --> 20:47.010
Yes.

20:48.380 --> 20:48.910
Yuanzhi.

20:49.320 --> 20:50.250
I called you here

20:50.710 --> 20:52.110
because I need your help.

20:53.550 --> 20:55.080
I'm at your service.

21:02.940 --> 21:03.470
Brother.

21:04.720 --> 21:05.440
So,

21:06.670 --> 21:08.200
you all knew this was a trap,

21:08.420 --> 21:09.620
but you didn't tell me

21:10.250 --> 21:12.030
and made me think I was being a hero?

21:12.030 --> 21:13.400
-Let me tell you in advance.
-Ziyu.

21:13.400 --> 21:14.410
With your temper,

21:14.660 --> 21:15.670
what can you hide?

21:17.090 --> 21:18.220
You're incompetent

21:18.940 --> 21:20.120
and a failure.

21:21.270 --> 21:23.200
Do you have that little faith in me?

21:23.310 --> 21:24.450
Look at yourself.

21:24.950 --> 21:26.250
You never focus on business.

21:26.250 --> 21:27.740
All you know is to run to Wanhua Pavilion.

21:27.740 --> 21:29.340
From inside and outside and head to toe,

21:29.340 --> 21:31.270
what is trustworthy about you?

21:50.620 --> 21:52.420
And what do you have in your hand?

21:57.830 --> 21:58.830
Today, I realized

21:59.190 --> 22:01.210
that there's something wrong with the Baizhi Jincao Tea

22:01.210 --> 22:02.700
that's being sent to the Ladies' Hostel.

22:02.700 --> 22:03.480
I suspect

22:03.940 --> 22:06.420
that Gong Yuanzhi changed the formula without permission

22:06.420 --> 22:08.680
to test the new medicine with the brides.

22:13.310 --> 22:14.760
I did change the formula.

22:19.130 --> 22:19.730
Ziyu.

22:21.020 --> 22:23.960
Do you know what the effect of Baizhi Jincao Tea is?

22:25.950 --> 22:27.530
To resist the poisonous miasma in the valley?

22:27.530 --> 22:31.390
Then have you noticed that the poisonous miasma has been increasing?

22:34.250 --> 22:36.220
You're always idle all day.

22:36.670 --> 22:38.350
You never once asked about the affairs of the Gong family.

22:38.350 --> 22:40.550
Of course you wouldn't have noticed it.

22:41.080 --> 22:43.510
Because the miasma is getting worse

22:44.060 --> 22:46.450
and the effect of the original formula is decreasing,

22:46.450 --> 22:49.440
I asked Gong Yuanzhi to come up with a new formula.

22:50.820 --> 22:52.620
Did you say he had no permission?

22:53.140 --> 22:53.870
Do you think

22:53.870 --> 22:55.840
all the Gong family's children are like you,

22:55.840 --> 22:57.150
who fancy themselves as smart

22:57.150 --> 22:59.080
and take action before reporting?

23:03.430 --> 23:04.230
Reporting to Lord Sword Wielder.

23:04.230 --> 23:05.420
Young Master Shangjue has entered the valley.

23:05.420 --> 23:07.480
He'll reach the Gong residence soon.

23:07.840 --> 23:08.570
Lord Sword Wielder.

23:08.570 --> 23:10.070
I want to go and welcome my brother.

23:10.070 --> 23:11.070
Please excuse me.

23:11.790 --> 23:12.230
Okay.

23:20.090 --> 23:21.090
You may leave too.

23:21.300 --> 23:21.850
Go back

23:22.380 --> 23:24.040
and reflect on your mistakes.

23:24.180 --> 23:25.640
You're not young anymore.

23:25.670 --> 23:27.540
You'd better think it over carefully.

23:27.540 --> 23:28.260
If

23:28.260 --> 23:30.660
you want to continue to be a useless person,

23:31.050 --> 23:32.900
you don't have to stay in the Gong residence.

23:32.900 --> 23:34.080
I don't really want to stay in the Gong residence anyway!

23:34.080 --> 23:34.480
You...

23:36.070 --> 23:36.550
Ziyu.

23:36.550 --> 23:37.140
Where are you going?

23:37.140 --> 23:38.000
Don't stop him!

23:38.340 --> 23:38.950
Let him go!

23:39.080 --> 23:39.740
Seriously.

23:39.810 --> 23:41.320
I can't even say a word.

23:41.340 --> 23:42.230
Father, Ziyu...

23:42.230 --> 23:43.380
He should go as far as possible.

23:43.380 --> 23:44.490
He'd better not come back

23:44.490 --> 23:47.290
and he'd better not show up at the wedding tonight!

23:50.710 --> 23:51.380
Father.

23:52.650 --> 23:53.250
All right.

23:55.380 --> 23:56.510
Go and get ready

23:57.390 --> 23:58.850
for your bride selection.

23:59.350 --> 24:00.610
Why are you still here?

24:02.020 --> 24:02.440
Go.

24:05.520 --> 24:06.110
Yes.

24:19.660 --> 24:20.500
Lady Wuji.

24:24.150 --> 24:26.440
I just saw that boy running away angrily.

24:27.450 --> 24:29.780
Did he make the Sword Wielder angry again?

24:30.330 --> 24:32.930
I'll have to trouble you to persuade my father.

24:37.620 --> 24:40.550
On such a joyful day of Young Lord's bride selection,

24:40.580 --> 24:42.640
why are you still fighting with Ziyu?

24:43.670 --> 24:45.710
He's old enough to get married.

24:45.940 --> 24:48.420
He's not the same kid who would just take your scolding.

24:48.420 --> 24:51.150
You should at least let him preserve his dignity.

24:53.310 --> 24:54.760
That brat.

24:55.850 --> 24:58.180
When he was a kid, he was obedient.

24:58.900 --> 25:00.360
But now that he's grown up,

25:00.830 --> 25:03.030
he's getting more and more rebellious.

25:03.790 --> 25:04.850
Whenever I see him,

25:05.010 --> 25:06.360
I get enraged.

25:07.700 --> 25:08.370
Tell me.

25:09.530 --> 25:11.380
He's idle every day.

25:12.090 --> 25:14.950
That's untypical of a son of mine.

25:16.780 --> 25:18.670
You can say that in front of me,

25:19.210 --> 25:21.610
but you must not say that in front of others,

25:21.990 --> 25:25.090
especially in front of the two brothers, Gong Shangjue and Gong Yuanzhi.

25:25.090 --> 25:25.960
You know

25:26.670 --> 25:28.670
that's what he cares about the most.

25:32.050 --> 25:33.080
In my opinion,

25:34.230 --> 25:35.600
he is the most like you.

25:36.500 --> 25:38.360
The two of you have the same temper

25:38.750 --> 25:41.550
and are never willing to say what's in your hearts.

25:42.280 --> 25:43.980
You clearly care about each other,

25:43.980 --> 25:45.780
but you still refuse to admit it.

25:46.210 --> 25:47.340
Listen to my advice.

25:48.140 --> 25:49.040
Find a chance

25:49.650 --> 25:51.370
to talk to him nicely.

25:53.350 --> 25:54.810
You're not young anymore.

25:55.620 --> 25:56.620
Just compromise.

25:58.500 --> 25:59.610
I'm his father.

26:00.260 --> 26:01.220
If someone has to compromise,

26:01.220 --> 26:02.590
it should be him.

26:04.250 --> 26:05.050
Fine.

26:06.020 --> 26:07.070
He'll compromise.

26:07.070 --> 26:08.490
Drink the soup first.

26:30.210 --> 26:32.340
Before the bride selection ceremony,

26:32.650 --> 26:34.580
the Gong family will arrange for a physician

26:34.580 --> 26:36.380
to check all the brides' pulses,

26:37.210 --> 26:38.670
evaluate your physiques,

26:38.990 --> 26:40.720
and check for hidden diseases.

26:49.480 --> 26:51.050
Then, he'll evaluate

26:51.370 --> 26:52.500
your body postures.

27:20.570 --> 27:21.320
After that,

27:21.360 --> 27:25.020
you'll drink the Gong family's secret medicine to heal your body.

27:48.530 --> 27:50.060
After all the assessments,

27:50.980 --> 27:52.780
the three tokens will be issued.

27:53.230 --> 27:54.150
The golden token,

27:54.150 --> 27:54.910
the white jade token,

27:54.910 --> 27:56.110
and the wooden token.

27:56.510 --> 27:58.440
The brides who get the golden token

27:58.440 --> 27:59.970
will stand in the first line

28:00.410 --> 28:02.270
at the bride selection ceremony.

28:03.900 --> 28:04.990
So, Yun Weishan,

28:06.740 --> 28:08.070
you need to try your best

28:08.270 --> 28:10.330
to get the golden token for yourself.

28:15.880 --> 28:16.610
Why?

28:29.910 --> 28:30.620
Why?

28:31.230 --> 28:32.890
I actually got a wooden token.

28:33.140 --> 28:35.070
At least give me a white jade token.

29:51.140 --> 29:52.140
I really envy you.

29:52.570 --> 29:54.770
Young Lord will definitely choose you.

29:55.210 --> 29:56.140
That's not true.

29:56.660 --> 29:58.390
Miss Yun has a golden token too.

30:01.200 --> 30:03.860
Based on my understanding of Young Lord Huanyu,

30:05.280 --> 30:07.010
he will definitely choose you.

30:08.280 --> 30:09.810
He won't choose Miss Jiang.

30:11.560 --> 30:12.270
Miss Yun.

30:12.570 --> 30:13.340
Don't worry.

30:14.540 --> 30:16.200
You know Young Lord very well.

30:17.190 --> 30:18.700
We're all after him.

30:18.950 --> 30:21.470
Of course we should know about him in advance.

30:21.470 --> 30:23.270
You should stop pretending too.

30:23.950 --> 30:24.730
Miss Yun.

30:25.090 --> 30:26.050
Don't worry.

30:27.020 --> 30:29.150
Even if Young Lord chooses Miss Jiang,

30:29.670 --> 30:30.740
there's still the Gong family's

30:30.740 --> 30:32.070
Young Master Shangjue.

30:32.670 --> 30:34.180
Gong Shangjue is old now.

30:34.870 --> 30:37.470
He wouldn't wait for the next bride selection.

30:37.920 --> 30:39.850
Young Master Shangjue's prestige

30:40.290 --> 30:42.290
is not lower than that of Young Lord.

30:42.980 --> 30:43.860
Miss Yun.

30:44.070 --> 30:46.110
You must want to be the wife of Young Lord,

30:46.110 --> 30:46.580
right?

30:47.710 --> 30:48.550
I don't care.

30:49.580 --> 30:51.780
Young Master Shangjue is a nice guy too.

30:55.080 --> 30:55.800
Not him.

30:59.010 --> 30:59.600
Why?

31:02.180 --> 31:03.110
Because

31:04.320 --> 31:06.050
I fancy Young Master Shangjue.

31:59.210 --> 32:00.010
Open the door.

32:04.130 --> 32:06.060
I said, open the door. I'm going out.

32:06.060 --> 32:07.030
Young Master Ziyu.

32:07.030 --> 32:08.410
Today is Young Lord Huanyu's wedding day.

32:08.410 --> 32:10.140
All the gates have been closed.

32:10.620 --> 32:11.420
The Sword Wielder

32:11.420 --> 32:12.830
has banned anyone from leaving.

32:12.830 --> 32:14.760
Here comes Young Master Shangjue.

33:34.080 --> 33:36.540
If Gong Huanyu didn't choose me as his bride,

33:36.960 --> 33:38.990
would that mean I failed my mission?

33:39.620 --> 33:40.360
If you fail,

33:41.470 --> 33:42.120
you die.

34:28.630 --> 34:31.290
I just finished reading the file you submitted.

34:31.550 --> 34:32.409
Sword Wielder.

34:35.310 --> 34:35.770
Come on.

34:36.260 --> 34:36.620
Sit.

34:40.500 --> 34:41.360
Sword Wielder.

34:42.449 --> 34:43.110
I can stand.

34:43.670 --> 34:44.389
It's okay.

34:45.580 --> 34:46.219
Sit down.

34:46.679 --> 34:47.880
I'll make us some tea.

34:49.179 --> 34:49.850
It's late.

34:50.710 --> 34:51.679
Drinking tea now

34:52.179 --> 34:53.610
may give you a sleepless night.

34:53.610 --> 34:54.340
Don't worry.

34:55.179 --> 34:56.380
I couldn't sleep well

34:56.400 --> 34:57.540
a while ago

34:58.360 --> 34:59.950
and asked Yuanzhi

34:59.970 --> 35:02.770
to make me an herbal tea that helps me sleep.

35:04.070 --> 35:05.200
Why don't you try it?

35:06.950 --> 35:09.010
The herbal tea Brother Yuanzhi made.

35:09.470 --> 35:11.270
I wouldn't miss it for the world.

35:17.510 --> 35:18.250
Sword Wielder.

35:18.250 --> 35:18.910
Let me do it.

35:25.580 --> 35:28.310
The Zheng family of Hunyuan and the Phoenix Villa

35:28.520 --> 35:30.260
refuse to bend to Wufeng.

35:31.340 --> 35:34.140
They want to seek protection from the Gong family.

35:35.870 --> 35:36.480
But…

35:38.600 --> 35:39.930
I see your dilemma.

35:42.050 --> 35:44.170
Since the accident ten years ago,

35:45.220 --> 35:47.750
the Gong family has been keeping a low profile

35:47.970 --> 35:49.570
and gathering our strength.

35:49.650 --> 35:51.450
There's really not much we can do

35:51.710 --> 35:53.240
to help those two families.

35:54.510 --> 35:56.630
Zheng Zhongyi, head of the Zheng family,

35:56.630 --> 35:57.890
is a friend of mine.

35:58.770 --> 35:59.760
I visited him

36:00.430 --> 36:02.090
and explained the situation.

36:03.790 --> 36:04.380
But

36:05.110 --> 36:07.050
to continue their family line,

36:08.010 --> 36:09.670
the Zheng family made their daughter,

36:09.670 --> 36:10.470
Zheng Nanyi,

36:11.370 --> 36:13.810
sign up for the marriage selection this year.

36:13.810 --> 36:14.540
By this time,

36:15.240 --> 36:17.840
she should have settled in the Gong Residence.

36:18.500 --> 36:19.210
Thank you.

36:20.550 --> 36:21.480
I just did my job.

36:22.990 --> 36:23.980
I intended

36:25.360 --> 36:27.210
to let you have a few days off.

36:28.580 --> 36:30.440
But I sent for you at this late hour

36:30.950 --> 36:33.610
because I have something important to tell you.

36:34.420 --> 36:35.340
I'm all ears.

36:38.510 --> 36:39.640
For the past decade,

36:40.550 --> 36:41.410
the Gong family

36:41.520 --> 36:42.910
has been accumulating wealth

36:42.910 --> 36:44.020
at a steady rate

36:44.380 --> 36:46.640
and become far richer than when the former Sword Wielder was in power.

36:46.640 --> 36:48.840
Your contribution to the accumulation

36:49.100 --> 36:50.230
of our family wealth

36:50.320 --> 36:51.730
didn't go unnoticed.

36:52.380 --> 36:53.810
The martial world thinks

36:54.350 --> 36:55.070
that you

36:55.470 --> 36:57.440
are the ablest one

36:58.010 --> 36:59.940
among your peers in the Gong family

36:59.940 --> 37:02.600
in terms of both martial arts and intelligence.

37:02.990 --> 37:04.190
It's just empty fame.

37:04.630 --> 37:06.030
Don't take it seriously.

37:06.470 --> 37:07.800
Wufeng is afraid of you.

37:08.300 --> 37:10.110
The martial world respects you.

37:12.190 --> 37:13.590
But in the martial world,

37:13.910 --> 37:15.000
in most cases,

37:15.860 --> 37:16.720
fear

37:17.540 --> 37:19.070
works better than respect.

37:20.900 --> 37:22.700
Whether they fear or respect me,

37:22.820 --> 37:24.460
it's because of the Gong family,

37:24.460 --> 37:25.570
not me.

37:26.510 --> 37:27.640
Shang, Jue, Zhi, Yu.

37:27.670 --> 37:28.760
These four lineages

37:28.760 --> 37:30.020
all have a role to play.

37:30.670 --> 37:32.670
The Shang Lineage forges

37:33.050 --> 37:34.250
and invents weapons.

37:34.750 --> 37:35.610
The Zhi Lineage

37:35.990 --> 37:38.150
creates all kinds of poisons and antidotes

37:38.150 --> 37:39.200
that can be used with hidden weapons.

37:39.200 --> 37:39.730
Brother.

37:40.340 --> 37:42.940
These are the gunpowder and hidden weapons from the Shang Lineage

37:42.940 --> 37:45.400
and the poisons and antidotes I made for you.

37:45.650 --> 37:47.110
If you need anything else,

37:47.330 --> 37:48.360
just let me know.

37:48.700 --> 37:49.310
Of course.

37:50.420 --> 37:51.950
The most important lineage

37:51.990 --> 37:52.940
is the Yu Lineage

37:53.510 --> 37:55.910
which runs the Gong family like a tight ship

37:56.510 --> 37:57.910
so that I do my job outside

37:58.060 --> 37:59.540
without worries.

38:02.620 --> 38:03.360
Shangjue.

38:05.100 --> 38:05.860
You

38:06.870 --> 38:07.960
are a clever man.

38:08.740 --> 38:10.160
I should apologize to you

38:10.880 --> 38:12.740
for the decision I made back then.

38:13.460 --> 38:13.990
The next

38:14.160 --> 38:15.230
Sword Wielder should…

38:15.230 --> 38:16.360
Lord Sword Wielder.

38:20.670 --> 38:21.420
It's late

38:22.660 --> 38:23.820
and I'm tired.

38:24.390 --> 38:25.920
If you have anything to say,

38:26.380 --> 38:27.350
just say it.

38:28.310 --> 38:29.370
I've been thinking

38:29.890 --> 38:31.650
about it for some time.

38:32.540 --> 38:33.100
Father.

38:38.190 --> 38:38.650
Father.

38:38.690 --> 38:39.950
When you came in,

38:40.020 --> 38:41.670
didn't the guards tell you

38:41.860 --> 38:43.920
that I don't want to be disturbed now?

38:45.730 --> 38:46.260
They did,

38:47.430 --> 38:49.220
but it's something urgent.

38:51.480 --> 38:53.080
Shangjue is not an outsider.

38:53.500 --> 38:54.360
Go ahead.

38:58.020 --> 39:00.420
I've found out the identity of the assassin

39:01.060 --> 39:02.720
Wufeng planted in the brides.

39:05.980 --> 39:06.710
She

39:08.250 --> 39:10.160
is the second daughter of the Zheng family of Hunyuan,

39:10.160 --> 39:10.890
Zheng Nanyi.

39:25.700 --> 39:26.760
It's getting late.

39:26.940 --> 39:28.000
I'll take my leave.

40:36.390 --> 40:38.110
What should I do

40:39.670 --> 40:41.470
if Gong Huanyu didn't choose me?

40:42.380 --> 40:44.440
You have to figure that out yourself.

40:48.510 --> 40:49.940
You're handy.

40:51.530 --> 40:52.840
You'll find a way.

40:57.980 --> 40:59.100
So, Yun Weishan,

41:00.130 --> 41:01.460
you need to try your best

41:01.700 --> 41:03.170
to get a golden token.

41:06.200 --> 41:07.000
It'd be better

41:07.650 --> 41:09.650
if you were the only girl getting it.

41:30.140 --> 41:31.400
It's chilly tonight.

41:31.780 --> 41:33.300
I'm afraid that you may catch a cold

41:33.300 --> 41:35.160
and was about to close the window.

41:44.680 --> 41:46.210
The wedding is coming soon.

41:46.530 --> 41:47.810
Why is he going out?

41:48.250 --> 41:49.110
Who do you mean?

41:49.910 --> 41:50.770
Gong Shangjue.

41:51.020 --> 41:52.350
Young Master Shangjue.

41:52.790 --> 41:53.920
Who cares about him?

42:06.530 --> 42:07.300
Just now,

42:08.730 --> 42:09.990
I dreamed of my mother.

42:12.530 --> 42:14.530
It must have been a beautiful dream.

42:18.060 --> 42:19.000
People say

42:19.740 --> 42:22.000
that dreams are the opposite of reality.

42:22.260 --> 42:23.920
The more beautiful a dream is,

42:24.070 --> 42:26.200
the sadder you will be after waking up.

42:33.750 --> 42:35.350
Because dreaming of someone

42:37.470 --> 42:39.070
means you can't be with them

42:41.230 --> 42:42.380
or have lost them.

43:03.410 --> 43:04.440
Now,

43:06.630 --> 43:08.490
I can only see my mother in dreams.

43:10.830 --> 43:13.690
So it doesn't matter whether it's a beautiful dream

43:15.870 --> 43:16.790
or a nightmare.

44:21.980 --> 44:23.580
Miss Jiang, you're here too.

44:45.460 --> 44:46.590
It's a private area.

44:46.790 --> 44:47.650
Do not disturb.

44:49.010 --> 44:50.270
How private?

44:50.500 --> 44:51.830
Who am I disturbing?

44:51.870 --> 44:54.240
Why don't you make it clear?

44:56.510 --> 44:57.350
Jin Fan!

44:57.830 --> 44:58.890
Eldest Young Miss.

45:01.660 --> 45:02.040
I…

45:03.150 --> 45:04.320
What a surprise.

45:04.740 --> 45:05.940
You're here too.

45:05.940 --> 45:06.870
Eldest Young Miss.

45:06.870 --> 45:08.200
What are you doing here?

45:08.670 --> 45:09.680
That's my line.

45:09.770 --> 45:11.100
What are you doing here?

45:11.680 --> 45:12.350
I'm here…

45:14.140 --> 45:15.400
Oh, Jin Fan.

45:16.020 --> 45:18.020
You look like a gentleman

45:18.190 --> 45:20.590
but actually visited somewhere like this.

45:25.810 --> 45:26.760
Do I look

45:27.120 --> 45:27.830
exotic?

45:30.920 --> 45:31.910
Very exotic.

45:44.170 --> 45:45.430
Yellow Jade Guardian.

45:46.590 --> 45:47.660
Seriously?

45:48.080 --> 45:50.460
Gong Ziyu is a regular here but no one came to take him back.

45:50.460 --> 45:51.820
This is my first time here

45:51.820 --> 45:54.420
but a Yellow Jade Guardian came to take me back.

45:54.800 --> 45:56.820
Maybe it's because Gong Ziyu didn't dress like you.

45:56.820 --> 45:58.020
The Council of Elders

45:58.270 --> 46:00.670
wants Young Master Ziyu back immediately.

46:04.590 --> 46:06.320
Sorry to disturb you this late.

46:06.780 --> 46:07.910
I couldn't sleep

46:08.860 --> 46:11.790
and saw the lights in Miss Shangguan's room still on,

46:11.820 --> 46:13.280
so I came for a little chat.

46:14.590 --> 46:16.080
Did I disturb you?

46:16.730 --> 46:17.640
No.

46:17.970 --> 46:19.370
I couldn’t sleep either,

46:19.460 --> 46:21.520
so I came to chat with Miss Shangguan.

46:23.580 --> 46:24.690
I thought

46:24.900 --> 46:26.940
I was the only one who couldn't sleep.

46:26.940 --> 46:30.350
It turned out that you can't sleep either, Miss Yun Weishan.

46:32.990 --> 46:33.850
Earlier today,

46:34.690 --> 46:37.000
I didn't get the chance to congratulate you

46:37.000 --> 46:39.460
on becoming Young Lord's bride, Miss Jiang.

46:39.710 --> 46:40.810
I envy you.

46:52.860 --> 46:55.120
The fragrance in the room smells so good.

46:57.360 --> 46:59.540
It's from an incense called Autumn Slumber.

46:59.540 --> 47:00.740
It's a well-known incense

47:00.740 --> 47:02.150
from my hometown.

47:03.070 --> 47:05.070
Miss Jiang said she couldn't sleep,

47:05.260 --> 47:06.710
so I decided to use it.

47:06.980 --> 47:09.440
It helps with sleeping and calms the nerves.

47:10.930 --> 47:12.690
If you like it, Miss Yun,

47:14.060 --> 47:15.010
I have more.

47:18.340 --> 47:19.390
Miss Shangguan

47:19.460 --> 47:20.470
insisted on letting me try

47:20.470 --> 47:23.110
some aged tea from her hometown in the middle of the night.

47:23.110 --> 47:23.830
I'm afraid

47:23.890 --> 47:25.290
I can't sleep well again.

47:25.800 --> 47:26.750
But it's good.

47:27.590 --> 47:28.850
The three of us can chat

47:29.000 --> 47:30.030
and relax.

47:35.680 --> 47:37.280
What were you talking about?

47:38.200 --> 47:39.640
Why do you look like

47:40.150 --> 47:42.010
you have been crying, Miss Jiang?

47:43.850 --> 47:45.050
We were talking about

47:45.090 --> 47:46.550
Miss Jiang's sweetheart.

47:49.140 --> 47:50.300
Her sweetheart?

47:52.120 --> 47:52.980
Miss Jiang

47:53.280 --> 47:55.140
has a sweetheart in her hometown.

47:55.480 --> 47:58.210
So she doesn't want to marry into the Gong family.

48:00.590 --> 48:01.410
Tell me.

48:01.910 --> 48:03.470
What can we do

48:04.120 --> 48:05.170
to help her?

48:18.740 --> 48:19.960
Miss Yun Weishan,

48:20.190 --> 48:21.250
do you not like tea?

48:23.910 --> 48:25.060
I'm a light sleeper.

48:26.490 --> 48:28.350
Judging from the color of the tea,

48:28.820 --> 48:30.220
it should be a strong tea.

48:31.070 --> 48:32.540
If I drink this,

48:32.660 --> 48:34.660
I'm afraid I can't sleep until dawn.

48:43.340 --> 48:45.340
Please have it instead, Miss Jiang.

48:46.280 --> 48:47.830
Don't be too upset.

48:48.210 --> 48:49.610
It's bad for your health.

48:51.300 --> 48:51.910
Yes.

48:52.940 --> 48:54.030
Young Lord

48:54.050 --> 48:55.910
has only temporarily chosen you.

48:56.380 --> 48:58.040
The wedding has yet to be held.

48:58.210 --> 48:59.810
Plans might still change.

49:02.050 --> 49:05.110
It would've been great if Miss Yun were chosen instead.

49:06.860 --> 49:08.820
It's rare for a bride of the Gong family

49:08.820 --> 49:10.690
to have her heart elsewhere

49:10.830 --> 49:12.350
like you, Miss Jiang.

49:13.120 --> 49:15.120
They all say the Gong family is good.

49:15.310 --> 49:17.570
It's a blessing to marry into the family.

49:19.300 --> 49:21.990
After Miss Jiang is sent to the Yu Lineage tomorrow,

49:21.990 --> 49:23.420
I'm afraid the rest of us

49:24.150 --> 49:26.410
will be ushered out of the Gong residence

49:26.500 --> 49:27.620
and sent home.

49:30.050 --> 49:31.610
You won't be sent home.

49:32.470 --> 49:34.020
According to the Gong family's rules of marriage selection,

49:34.020 --> 49:36.100
even if you're not chosen by the young lord,

49:36.100 --> 49:37.870
all the bride candidates will be

49:37.870 --> 49:39.840
given a good family to marry to.

49:40.310 --> 49:42.040
First, these bride candidates

49:42.260 --> 49:44.780
are the daughters of the Gong family's allies in the martial world.

49:44.780 --> 49:46.860
The Gong family cannot embarrass anyone.

49:46.860 --> 49:49.190
Second, the Gong family is very cautious.

49:49.630 --> 49:51.690
It tries to keep people who come here.

49:52.030 --> 49:54.860
Miss Yun and Miss Shangguan, with your beauty,

49:55.620 --> 49:57.820
you will certainly find a good husband.

49:58.060 --> 49:59.230
I hope so.

50:00.280 --> 50:00.910
Besides,

50:01.230 --> 50:02.800
Young Master Shangjue

50:03.120 --> 50:04.630
and Young Master Ziyu

50:05.160 --> 50:06.420
are not married yet.

50:07.820 --> 50:09.630
So don't worry.

50:12.360 --> 50:13.100
Miss Jiang,

50:13.370 --> 50:14.380
you are so nice.

50:17.020 --> 50:18.080
I wish that

50:18.620 --> 50:20.820
your dreams will come true, Miss Jiang.

50:30.990 --> 50:32.390
After drinking this tea,

50:32.420 --> 50:33.510
I should rest.

50:36.540 --> 50:37.720
We should rest too.

50:55.020 --> 50:56.710
-Did you do something again?
-Did you do something again?

50:56.710 --> 50:58.770
Of course it has nothing to do with me!

50:59.790 --> 51:02.670
They said that the Elders wanted to see Young Master Ziyu.

51:02.670 --> 51:04.500
Am I Young Master Ziyu?

51:06.100 --> 51:06.700
Forget it.

51:07.000 --> 51:09.080
No matter what I do, I can't escape it.

51:10.250 --> 51:11.510
Let's wait until we get there.

51:11.510 --> 51:13.370
It's not necessarily a bad thing.

51:15.230 --> 51:16.890
Don't you have a mirror in your room?

51:16.890 --> 51:18.740
If not, you should drink more water,

51:18.740 --> 51:21.010
so you can see your reflection when you relieve yourself.

51:21.010 --> 51:22.210
It may be a good thing

51:22.230 --> 51:24.240
if the Elders were meeting Gong Shangjue or Gong Yuanzhi.

51:24.240 --> 51:25.040
But us?

51:25.110 --> 51:26.510
You and me?

51:28.590 --> 51:30.230
The last time I went to the Council of Elders,

51:30.230 --> 51:32.760
they almost skinned me before they let me out.

51:33.240 --> 51:35.500
Look at what you're wearing. They'll skin you for sure this time.

51:35.500 --> 51:36.430
What do you know?

51:36.830 --> 51:39.770
This is the latest autumn and winter style from Jiangnan.

51:39.770 --> 51:40.610
It's classy.

51:40.630 --> 51:41.430
Understand?

51:42.670 --> 51:43.760
It's quite mixed.

51:43.990 --> 51:45.120
But it's not classy.

51:45.540 --> 51:47.200
I feel cold just looking at it.

51:47.940 --> 51:49.140
You might be weak and sickly,

51:49.140 --> 51:51.380
but the rest of the world isn't afraid of the cold like you.

51:51.380 --> 51:52.370
Who was it?

51:52.390 --> 51:55.000
Who cried eating ice in the hot June weather?

51:55.100 --> 51:56.990
You don't have the right to feel cold for others.

51:56.990 --> 51:58.840
I was only seven then.

51:58.860 --> 52:01.070
By age seven, your development for the rest of your life is determined.

52:01.070 --> 52:02.470
Stop talking about this.

52:02.520 --> 52:04.540
I'm telling you, it's all your fault today.

52:04.540 --> 52:05.670
If it weren't for you,

52:05.670 --> 52:07.180
how could such a classy person like me

52:07.180 --> 52:09.200
go to such an unclassy place?

52:09.620 --> 52:10.230
Also,

52:10.750 --> 52:12.030
can you stop taking Jinfan

52:12.030 --> 52:13.530
to brothels?

52:13.670 --> 52:15.200
You're leading him astray.

52:17.260 --> 52:20.390
I'm leading him astray, so you'll have a chance with him.

52:26.130 --> 52:27.430
I have a bad feeling.

52:28.590 --> 52:29.530
The Yellow Jade Guardian

52:29.530 --> 52:31.590
only accepts orders from the Elders.

52:32.140 --> 52:34.200
Looks like we're in for some trouble.

52:34.760 --> 52:37.620
Truly, you get to see everything if you live long enough.

52:37.620 --> 52:39.320
Maybe I will even see

52:39.660 --> 52:41.590
the Red Jade Guardian in this life.

52:47.240 --> 52:49.240
Is there really a Red Jade Guardian?

52:50.580 --> 52:52.790
I think the Elders lied to us.

52:53.230 --> 52:54.340
To me, Red Jade Guardian

52:54.340 --> 52:56.800
is just like Nuwa and Fuxi.

52:56.950 --> 52:59.260
They are all people from myths and legends.

52:59.260 --> 53:00.980
Why did you change the subject again?

53:00.980 --> 53:01.840
Let me tell you.

53:01.940 --> 53:03.800
Drop me off at the Gong residence.

53:04.090 --> 53:05.980
I can’t accompany you to the Council of Elders.

53:05.980 --> 53:08.180
They clearly stated that they want you.

53:08.180 --> 53:09.800
I'll now cut ties with you.

53:10.140 --> 53:10.940
Sorry.

53:10.940 --> 53:11.900
Then get off now.

53:11.900 --> 53:12.410
Can I?

53:12.640 --> 53:13.700
Stop the carriage.

53:33.600 --> 53:35.620
Why did my brother leave in such a hurry?

53:35.620 --> 53:37.680
This mission was posted directly by Sword Wielder.

53:37.680 --> 53:39.410
I don't know anything about it.

53:39.610 --> 53:40.240
Besides,

53:40.950 --> 53:42.300
there is no checkpoint along the way

53:42.300 --> 53:44.500
to tell where Young Master Shangjue is.

53:46.140 --> 53:47.230
He went out alone.

53:48.580 --> 53:49.910
He even left you behind.

53:53.180 --> 53:54.710
Why did the lantern on the tower

53:54.710 --> 53:55.720
turn red?

53:58.140 --> 53:59.270
A red light warning.

54:00.780 --> 54:02.980
It's been years since the previous one.

54:15.090 --> 54:16.220
Whose funeral is it?

54:16.270 --> 54:17.130
What happened?

54:20.570 --> 54:21.100
Brother.

54:22.100 --> 54:22.960
Come back soon.

54:25.380 --> 54:26.180
Something bad

54:28.070 --> 54:30.330
is about to happen in the Gong residence.

55:10.820 --> 55:12.750
All female guests come out of the room.

55:12.750 --> 55:13.750
Count the number.

57:23.580 --> 57:24.400
My lords,

57:25.180 --> 57:25.910
are you

57:26.460 --> 57:28.490
looking for Miss Yun Weishan?

57:29.750 --> 57:31.150
She's resting in my room.

57:32.250 --> 57:33.980
Why didn't you tell us earlier?

57:35.780 --> 57:36.450
Because...

57:38.950 --> 57:41.730
Miss Yun Weishan seems to have eaten something wrong.

57:41.730 --> 57:43.530
She has rashes all over her face.

57:44.080 --> 57:46.450
She doesn't want others to see her like that.

57:46.450 --> 57:46.980
And...

57:47.630 --> 57:48.910
It looks very scary.

57:50.340 --> 57:52.270
She's afraid of infecting others.

58:29.200 --> 58:30.200
Miss Yun Weishan.

58:31.200 --> 58:32.460
Please show your face.

58:45.330 --> 58:47.020
You said she's afraid of infecting others.

58:47.020 --> 58:48.550
Then why is she

58:48.550 --> 58:49.870
resting in your room

58:50.460 --> 58:51.790
instead of her own room?

58:53.630 --> 58:56.110
Why is she in my room?

58:56.360 --> 58:56.970
Yes.

58:57.370 --> 58:58.190
I'm asking you.
